  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 9:8. After 12 years, the ratio will be 13:12. What is Priya''s present age?', array['24 years', '27 years', '30 years', '39 years'], 1, 'Let the ages be 9x and 8x. Then 12(9x + 12) = 13(8x + 12), which gives x = 3. Priya is 9 × 3 = 27 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 4:3. After 8 years, the ratio will be 16:13. What is Priya''s present age?', array['18 years', '30 years', '32 years', '24 years'], 3, 'Let the ages be 4x and 3x. Then 13(4x + 8) = 16(3x + 8), which gives x = 6. Priya is 4 × 6 = 24 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 6:1. After 14 years, the ratio will be 19:9. What is Priya''s present age?', array['38 years', '4 years', '28 years', '24 years'], 3, 'Let the ages be 6x and 1x. Then 9(6x + 14) = 19(1x + 14), which gives x = 4. Priya is 6 × 4 = 24 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 4:1. After 12 years, the ratio will be 7:4. What is Priya''s present age?', array['16 years', '20 years', '4 years', '28 years'], 0, 'Let the ages be 4x and 1x. Then 4(4x + 12) = 7(1x + 12), which gives x = 4. Priya is 4 × 4 = 16 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 5:3. After 7 years, the ratio will be 3:2. What is Priya''s present age?', array['42 years', '28 years', '21 years', '35 years'], 3, 'Let the ages be 5x and 3x. Then 2(5x + 7) = 3(3x + 7), which gives x = 7. Priya is 5 × 7 = 35 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 8:7. After 14 years, the ratio will be 15:14. What is Priya''s present age?', array['30 years', '16 years', '18 years', '14 years'], 1, 'Let the ages be 8x and 7x. Then 14(8x + 14) = 15(7x + 14), which gives x = 2. Priya is 8 × 2 = 16 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 8:3. After 4 years, the ratio will be 12:5. What is Priya''s present age?', array['21 years', '63 years', '60 years', '56 years'], 3, 'Let the ages be 8x and 3x. Then 5(8x + 4) = 12(3x + 4), which gives x = 7. Priya is 8 × 7 = 56 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 9:5. After 14 years, the ratio will be 17:11. What is Priya''s present age?', array['60 years', '68 years', '54 years', '30 years'], 2, 'Let the ages be 9x and 5x. Then 11(9x + 14) = 17(5x + 14), which gives x = 6. Priya is 9 × 6 = 54 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 7:3. After 3 years, the ratio will be 15:7. What is Priya''s present age?', array['18 years', '45 years', '42 years', '48 years'], 2, 'Let the ages be 7x and 3x. Then 7(7x + 3) = 15(3x + 3), which gives x = 6. Priya is 7 × 6 = 42 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 6:5. After 2 years, the ratio will be 20:17. What is Priya''s present age?', array['21 years', '20 years', '15 years', '18 years'], 3, 'Let the ages be 6x and 5x. Then 17(6x + 2) = 20(5x + 2), which gives x = 3. Priya is 6 × 3 = 18 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
  ('quant', 'Ages', 3, 'The present ages of Priya and Karan are in the ratio 6:1. After 5 years, the ratio will be 7:2. What is Priya''s present age?', array['5 years', '35 years', '25 years', '30 years'], 3, 'Let the ages be 6x and 1x. Then 2(6x + 5) = 7(1x + 5), which gives x = 5. Priya is 6 × 5 = 30 years old.', 55, 'ages_ratio', null, null, null),
