  ('reasoning', 'Pattern Matrix', 2, 'Which figure completes the grid?', array['Figure A', 'Figure B', 'Figure C', 'Figure D'], 3, 'Every row and every column has one circle, one square and one triangle, and one empty, one dotted and one solid shape. The bottom row is missing a circle and the right column is missing a dotted shape, so the answer is the dotted circle: option D.', 50, 'pattern_matrix', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 300 300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 5H295V295H5Z" stroke-width="2" opacity=".35"/><path d="M100 5V295M200 5V295M5 100H295M5 200H295" stroke-width="2" opacity=".35"/><path d="M50 24L76 70H24Z" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="150" cy="50" r="24"/><circle cx="150" cy="50" r="6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><rect x="228" y="28" width="44" height="44"/><circle cx="50" cy="150" r="24"/><circle cx="50" cy="150" r="6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><rect x="128" y="128" width="44" height="44"/><path d="M250 124L276 170H224Z" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="28" y="228" width="44" height="44"/><path d="M150 224L176 270H124Z" fill="currentColor"/><text x="250" y="250" font-size="44" font-weight="700" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">?</text></svg>', array['<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="28" y="28" width="44" height="44"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M50 24L76 70H24Z"/><circle cx="50" cy="55" r="6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>', '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill